# =============================================================================
# PROJECT HEDGE — NATS user credentials TEMPLATE for account: supervisor
#
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL JWTs OR NKEY SEEDS. This file ships as a placeholder so
# the docker-compose volume mounts resolve. To mint real credentials run:
#
#   docker/nats/provision-creds.sh
#
# Account permissions enforced by `docker/nats/nats-server.conf`:
#   publish    : ops.action.>  obs.>
#   subscribe  : obs.>  md.connection.>  cache.redis.>  broker.metric.>
#                obs.latency.>  obs.budget.breach.>  obs.error.>
#                ai.ollama.degraded  exec.broker.failover
#
# Self_Healing_Supervisor consumes the failure-detection event surface
# (R25.1–R25.5) and emits recovery actions on `ops.action.*`. Subscribe
# scope is intentionally narrow so the supervisor's own bandwidth and
# blast radius stay small.
# =============================================================================

